    "HomeKit 기준 응답함 %lld/%lld" : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard Apple Home status: devices HomeKit reports as responding / listed devices (a device whose value read failed can still respond)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Responding per HomeKit: %1$lld/%2$lld"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Responden según HomeKit: %1$lld/%2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HomeKit 기준 %lld개 중 %lld개 응답함" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver, Dashboard Apple Home status: listed devices, of which HomeKit reports this many as responding",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%2$lld of %1$lld responding per HomeKit"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%2$lld de %1$lld responden según HomeKit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘%@’에 있는 기기는 미지정 공간으로 이동합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Delete-room confirmation; the room name is user data",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Devices in “%@” will move to Unassigned."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los dispositivos de “%@” se moverán a Sin asignar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘허브 찾기’로 같은 네트워크의 센서 허브를 찾거나, 허브의 주소를 직접 입력하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Settings footer while connecting by a typed address",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use “Find Hubs” to find the sensor hub on your network, or enter the hub’s address yourself."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa “Buscar hubs” para encontrar el hub de sensores de tu red o escribe tú la dirección del hub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘허브 찾기’로 선택한 허브만 설정을 공유할 수 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings error: sharing needs a hub picked in Find hubs",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Settings can only be shared with a hub chosen in “Find Hubs”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo se pueden compartir ajustes con un hub elegido en “Buscar hubs”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘허브 찾기’로 선택한 허브와 설정을 공유할 수 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings: needs a hub picked in Find hubs",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can share settings with a hub chosen in “Find Hubs”."
