    },
    "공유 상태" : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings: status row label",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sharing"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uso compartido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "공유하면 집 이름, 방, 조각보 센서 이름과 방 배치가 같은 허브를 쓰는 iPhone, iPad, Mac에 똑같이 표시됩니다. 센서 값, Apple 홈, 모의 데이터, 언어·화면 설정, Watch에 표시할 센서는 공유하지 않습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings footer: what is and isn't shared",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When shared, the home name, rooms, and Jogakbo sensor names and rooms look the same on every iPhone, iPad and Mac using this hub. Sensor values, Apple Home, simulated data, language and display settings, and the sensors shown on Apple Watch aren’t shared."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al compartir, el nombre de la casa, las habitaciones y los nombres y habitaciones de los sensores Jogakbo se ven igual en todos los iPhone, iPad y Mac que usan este hub. No se comparten los valores de los sensores, Apple Casa, los datos simulados, el idioma ni la pantalla, ni los sensores que muestra el Apple Watch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "광고한 허브와 응답한 허브가 달라 연결하지 않았습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Hub discovery: advertised and answered hub_id differ",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not connected: the hub that answered isn’t the one that was announced."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se ha conectado: el hub que respondió no es el que se anunció."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "권한 없음" : {
      "comment" : "Watch: Apple Home action failed for lack of permission",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No permission"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sin permiso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "권한 요청에 답하면 Apple 홈의 기기 목록을 가져옵니다." : {
      "comment" : "Apple Home notice: waiting for permission / first home list",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once you answer the permission request, the Apple Home device list is loaded."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando respondas a la solicitud de permiso, se cargará la lista de dispositivos de Apple Home."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "그 사이 다른 기기가 먼저 올렸다면 덮어쓰지 않고 그 설정을 사용합니다. 이 기기에 저장된 기존 설정은 그대로 보관됩니다." : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings setup: first upload never overwrites",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If another device uploaded first in the meantime, its settings are used instead — nothing is overwritten. The settings saved on this device are kept."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si otro dispositivo subió los suyos antes, se usan esos en su lugar: no se sobrescribe nada. Los ajustes guardados en este dispositivo se conservan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
