    "연결과 업데이트 상태" : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard section subtitle",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connection and update status"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estado de conexión y actualización"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "연결되지 않으면 이 Mac이 Linux Bridge와 같은 네트워크에 있는지, 시스템 설정 > 개인정보 보호 및 보안 > 로컬 네트워크에서 조각보 홈이 켜져 있는지 확인하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Mac: hint shown while Live mode isn't connected",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If it doesn't connect, check that this Mac is on the same network as the Linux bridge and that Jogakbo Home is turned on in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Local Network."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si no se conecta, comprueba que este Mac esté en la misma red que el puente Linux y que Jogakbo Home esté activado en Ajustes del Sistema > Privacidad y seguridad > Red local."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "연결되지 않으면 이 기기가 Linux Bridge와 같은 Wi-Fi에 있는지, 설정 > 개인정보 보호 및 보안 > 로컬 네트워크에서 조각보 홈이 켜져 있는지 확인하세요." : {
      "comment" : "iPhone/iPad: hint shown while Live mode isn't connected",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If it doesn't connect, check that this device is on the same Wi-Fi as the Linux bridge and that Jogakbo Home is turned on in Settings > Privacy & Security > Local Network."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si no se conecta, comprueba que este dispositivo esté en la misma red Wi-Fi que el puente Linux y que Jogakbo Home esté activado en Ajustes > Privacidad y seguridad > Red local."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "연결된 Linux Bridge가 Power Base 정보를 보내지 않습니다. 새 Power Base를 확인하려면 Bridge를 이 버전 이상으로 업데이트해야 합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Bridge too old",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The connected Linux bridge doesn't report Power Bases. Update the bridge to this version or later to see a new Power Base."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El puente Linux conectado no informa de Power Bases. Actualiza el puente a esta versión o posterior para ver una nueva Power Base."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "연결된 조각보 센서가 없습니다" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
