            "value" : "Abre Jogakbo Home"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "조각보 홈에서 Apple 홈 연결이 꺼져 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Sensor widget: Apple Home is turned off in PogoHome",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Home is turned off in Jogakbo Home."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
